### Search tutorials by intent

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@intent = mechanical service
@max_num_results = 10

POST {{baseUrl}}/semantic-search/tutorial-transcript
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="transcriptFile"; filename="tutorial-transcript.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a sample tutorial transcript.
It explains how semantic search works step by step.
< ./assets/tutorial-transcript-example.txt
--boundary--

